# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Vite Dev Server
# ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Dev env is consolidated in the monorepo root .env (see ../../.env.example).
# The Vite dev server reads it via loadEnv(<repo root>) in vite.config.ts —
# set VITE_DEV_PORT / VITE_DEV_HOST there, not here.
#
# Dev URL routing is handled by nsl (http://bkd.localhost). The Vite dev
# server no longer proxies /api/* — access the app via bkd.localhost.
